      "writtenOn": "2021-04-27T15:36:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This looks great, Thanks!\n\nDo we need to update the following code: https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/port80.c;l\u003d55\n\n```\nstatic uint16_t __bss_slow history[CONFIG_PORT80_HISTORY_LEN];\n```\n\nI think we need to update the data type too. This all can be done in a different CL since it\u0027s common code.",
      "parentUuid": "411ed1bf_e9c60127",
